# PDF export popups

When adding or changing a PDF export options popup, do **not** tell the user that the report is generated in light mode.

Never include copy such as:

- "The report is always generated in light mode."
- "The report is always light mode."
- "Always generated in light mode"

The PDF itself must still be light mode (white page, dark text). Just do not say that on the popup.

Other helper text is fine (for example, that attachment filenames appear at the end).
